# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002223> (starts)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002223> "inverse of starts with")
