# Object Property: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002352> (input of)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002352> "inverse of has input")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002352> "RO:0002352")
