# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001382> (Joint hypermobility)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <https://orcid.org/0000-0002-0736-9199>) Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:28145606") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0001382> "The capability that a joint (or a group of joints) has to move, passively and/or actively, beyond normal limits along physiological axes.")
