AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:22371254") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:27460346") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0013731> "A congenital myopathy caused by mutations in the multiple epidermal growth factor-like domains 10 (MEGF10) gene, which causes early-onset myopathy characterized by severe weakness, scoliosis, joint contractures, areflexia, respiratory distress, and dysphagia, and a milder phenotype of minicore myopathy.")
