AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "Orphanet:99734") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0020481> "Myotonia fluctuans (MF) is a form of potassium-aggravated myotonia (PAM) which is cold insensitive, dramatically fluctuating and profoundly worsened by potassium ingestion.")
