# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0100584> (SNUPN-related muscular dystrophy with or without multi-system involvement)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:38366623") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "PMID:38413582") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0100584> "A form of congenital muscular dystrophy in which the cause of the disease is pathogenic variation in the SNUPN gene. The phenotype is typically characterized by a variable degree of muscle weakness, elevated serum creatinine kinase, and myopathic signs in skeletal muscle. Extra-muscular features involving the ocular, skeletal, respiratory, and central nervous system may also be present.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#source> "MONDO:GARD") <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MONDO_0100584> "GARD:0027279")
