AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym> <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/100> "Ubiquitin-like activating enzymes")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/100> "Ubiquitin like modifier activating enzymes")
SubClassOf(<https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/100> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SO_0005855>)

