AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/1033> "SCYL (SCY1) is a family of pseudokinases found in almost all eukaryotes, involved in trafficking of secretory proteins, nuclear tRNA export, and chromosome biology.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasSynonymType> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0003000>) <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym> <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/1033> "SCYL")
