AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/1331> "This is an actin-regulating complex that is recruited to endosomes by interactions with the retromer complex and plays a role in endosomal sorting.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym> <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/1331> "Wiskott–Aldrich syndrome protein and SCAR homolog complex")
