# Class: <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/1428> (G protein subunits alpha, group i)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/1428> "This family consists of the G protein alpha subunit group I (inhibitory), which includes G alpha-I, G alpha-O, G alpha-T and G alpha-Z. G alpha-I proteins were originally identified by their receptor-mediated inhibition of the cAMP-generating enzyme adenylyl cyclase.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym> <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/1428> "G inhibitory subunits")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym> <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/1428> "G(I)alpha subunits")
