# Class: <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/1430> (G protein subunits beta)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/1430> "Guanine nucleotide binding proteins (G proteins) are membrane-associated, heterotrimeric proteins composed of three subunits: alpha, beta and gamma. This entry consists of the G protein beta subunit, which assumes a barrel-shaped beta-propeller structure containing WD-40 repeats preceded by an N-terminal alpha helix. The beta subunit forms a stable dimer with the gamma subunit. The alpha subunit only contacts the beta subunit in the dimer, lying on the opposite face from the gamma subunit.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym> <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/1430> "G(I)/G(S)/G(T) subunits beta")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasSynonymType> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/OMO_0003000>) <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym> <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/1430> "GNB")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym> <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/1430> "guanine nucleotide-binding protein G(I)/G(S)/G(T) subunits beta")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/1430> "G protein subunits beta")
SubClassOf(<https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/1430> <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/1431>)

# Class: <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/1431> (Heterotrimeric G proteins)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/1431> "'G protein' usually refers to the membrane-associated heterotrimeric G proteins, sometimes referred to as the 'large' G proteins (as opposed to the subclass of smaller, monomeric small GTPases). These proteins are activated by G protein-coupled receptors and are made up of alpha, beta and gamma subunits, the latter two referred to as the beta-gamma complex")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym> <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/1431> "G-proteins")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym> <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/1431> "Guanosine nucleotide-binding proteins")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym> <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/1431> "Large G proteins")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/1431> "Heterotrimeric G proteins")
SubClassOf(<https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/1431> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/SO_0005855>)

