# Class: <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/3565> (GTPases)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/3565> "The group represents genes encoding enzymes of the class 3.6.5.-, hydrolases that act of GTP.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasRelatedSynonym> <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/3565> "GTPases")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/3565> "GTPases")
