AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/426> "Beta 3-glycosyltransferases")
SubClassOf(<https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/426> <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/424>)

