SubClassOf(<https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/427> <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/424>)

# Class: <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/430> (Dolichyl D-mannosyl phosphate dependent mannosyltransferases)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/430> "This functional set of mannosyltransferases all use dolichyl D-mannosyl phosphate (dol-P-Man) as a sugar donor.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/430> "Dolichyl D-mannosyl phosphate dependent mannosyltransferases")
SubClassOf(<https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/430> <https://www.genenames.org/data/genegroup/#!/group/424>)

